      "title": "Office of Personal Career Development",
      "description": "Office of Personal Career Development - University of Dallas Skip to main content Toggle menu UD Police News Events Library My UD Academics Academics Overview Program Finder Bulletin & Course Catalog Colleges & Schools The Rome Experience Faculty The Neuhoff Institute Centers & Institutes Admissions & Aid Admissions & Aid Overview Undergraduate Admissions & Aid Graduate Admissions & Aid Ministry Admissions Financial Aid Visit UD Contact Admissions Life at UD Life at UD Overview Student Clubs & Organizations Housing & Dining Health & Wellness Campus Ministry Office of Student Life Office of Personal Career Development Academic Success Library Bookstore Faith & Service Faith & Service Overview Our Catholic Faith Serving Others Serving the Church Church of the Incarnation Athletics About UD About the University Academic Excellence UD At a Glance Dallas/Fort Worth Area Leadership Mission & Vision Offices & Services INFO FOR Alumni Donors Parents & Families Visitors The Core is an opportunity to inquire into the fundamental aspects of being and our\n               relationship with God, nature and our fellow human beings. Explore the Core Toggle search search Search Popular Searches Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Core Curriculum Library Financial Aid University of Dallas University of Dallas Apply Request Info Visit Give Office of Personal Career Development Home - Life at UD - Student Support Resources - Personal Career Development Welcome to the Office of Personal Career Development (OPCD) We help you achieve professional success beyond UD. Our mission is to equip students for success in their professional careers. We are\n                        here to guide you in exploring opportunities, gaining experience to develop your skills,\n                        and making informed decisions that will shape your future. You can contact us at career@udallas.edu , call us at 972-721-4127, or visit us in Cardinal Farrell Hall, Room 204. Students Start Here Register Your Internship for Course Credit Schedule an Advising Appointment Meet the Team Our Resources UD Odyssey UD Odyssey Student Resources UD Odyssey Faculty Resources Students & Alumni Career and Major Exploration Job Search Resources Resume and Cover Letter Networking and LinkedIn Interview Preparation International Students Alumni Resources Handshake Log in to Handshake Schedule an Appointment Career Tips from Handshake Internship Course Credit Graduate & Professional School Prestigious Scholarships & Fellowships Graduate School Professional School (Law, Medical) Employers Recruiting at UD Career Fairs Student Outcomes Undergraduate Students Graduate Students Keep Exploring Discover the University of Dallas Cost and Aid Core Curriculum University of Dallas Apply Request Info Visit Give 1845 East Northgate Drive Irving, Texas 75062-4736 (972) 721-5000 DIRECTIONS CONTACT US Accessibility Services Bookstore Campus Map Compliance Reporting Hotline Consumer Information Directory Employment Events Library News Offices & Services Online Disclosure Statement Title IX & Sexual Violence Thoughts from the Tower Blog UD Police University Policies © 2026 University of Dallas LinkedIn Facebook Instagram Twitter YouTube Podcasts ©"
